3.5,3.2,2.9,2.6,2.2],"g1":5.4,"g2":3.5,"g":2.25,"wacc":8.85,"ev":7126.1,"fmp_official_ev":7126.1,"enterpriseValueBasis":"USD market capitalization + USD debt - USD cash and short-term investments","dcf_model_ev":7294.2,"ev_to_ebitda":3.6,"debt_to_ebitda":0.43,"net_debt_to_ebitda":-1.47,"f_score":4,"f_score_breakdown":[{"id":1,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率 ROA > 0","passed":1,"detail":"當期 ROA = 2.2%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $418M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":0,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":0,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 86.6%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 4.44"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":67.81,"default_fair_val":67.81,"premium_pct":-1.7,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":10.2,"pe_forward":9,"pb_trailing":1.7,"pb_forward":1.5,"div_yield":2.56,"ps_ratio":6,"fcf_to_ev":5.86,"fcf_to_mcap":4.17,"liab_to_assets":86.6,"cash_to_assets":8.3,"current_ratio":4.44,"roe":16.2,"roa":2.2,"moat":{"ticker":"SF","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Stifel Financial 的品牌定價權相對穩健，主要體現在其作為一家歷史悠久且信譽良好的投資銀行，在為高淨值客戶和機構提供財富管理、投資銀行及證券經紀服務時，能夠收取合理的費用。其品牌價值建立在專業知識、客戶關係和過往的成功交易記錄之上。然而，與頂級的全球投資銀行相比，其品牌影響力尚有差距，這限制了其在極端市場條件下維持高價的能力。其客戶群體對價格相對不敏感，但競爭對手亦提供類似服務，故其定價權並非絕對壟斷。","comment_en":"Stifel Financial's brand pricing power is relatively solid, primarily reflected in its ability to charge reasonable fees as a long-standing and reputable investment bank providing wealth management, investment banking, and brokerage services to high-net-worth clients and institutions. Its brand value is built on expertise, client relationships, and a track record of successful transactions. However, compared to top-tier global investment banks, its brand influence has some gaps, limiting its ability to maintain premium pricing in extreme market conditions. Its client base is relatively price-insensitive, but competitors offer similar services, so its pricing power is not an absolute monopoly."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"Stifel Financial 在金融服務業的運營，主要依賴監管牌照和行業規範，而非專利技術。其壁壘主要來自於進入市場的監管門檻和合規要求，這對新進入者構成一定的障礙。然而，這些監管壁壘並非專屬性或獨特性，許多競爭對手同樣持有必要的牌照。公司在合規方面的投入是必要的成本，而非能轉化為顯著的競爭優勢或定價權。因此，此類壁壘的強度相對有限，且易受監管政策變動影響。","comment_en":"Stifel Financial's operations in the financial services industry rely primarily on regulatory licenses and industry standards rather than patented technology. Its barriers mainly stem from regulatory hurdles and compliance requirements for market entry, which pose some obstacles to new entrants. However, these regulatory barriers are not exclusive or unique, and many competitors also hold the necessary licenses. The company's investment in compliance is a necessary cost rather than a significant competitive advantage or pricing power. Therefore, the strength of these barriers is relatively limited and susceptible to changes in regulatory policy."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Stifel Financial 在財富管理和機構服務領域，面臨客戶轉換成本較高的情況。一旦客戶將其資產委託給 Stifel，並建立起信任關係，遷移到其他機構將涉及時間、精力、潛在的稅務影響以及對新服務提供者信任建立的挑戰。特別是對於複雜的投資組合和長期的財務規劃，客戶傾向於維持現狀。這種黏性為 Stifel 提供了穩定的客戶基礎和經常性收入，是其重要的護城河之一。","comment_en":"In wealth management and institutional services, Stifel Financial faces relatively high customer switching costs. Once clients entrust their assets to Stifel and establish a trusting relationship, moving to another institution involves time, effort, potential tax implications, and the challenge of building trust with a new service provider. Especially for complex investment portfolios and long-term financial planning, clients tend to maintain the status quo. This stickiness provides Stifel with a stable client base and recurring revenue, making it one of its significant moats."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"Stifel Financial 的網絡效應相對較弱。雖然其作為一家金融機構，內部各部門（如投資銀行、經紀、研究）之間可能存在協同作用，但這種協同並非典型的網絡效應，即用戶越多，服務價值越高的情況。其客戶群體主要是機構和高淨值個人，他們更看重服務的質量和專業性，而非平台的用戶數量。雖然公司可能透過其經紀網絡接觸到更多潛在客戶，但這種聯繫並未形成強大的、自我強化的網絡效應壁壘。","comment_en":"Stifel Financial's network effects are relatively weak. While as a financial institution, there might be synergies between its various internal divisions (e.g., investment banking, brokerage, research), this synergy is not a typical network effect where more users lead to increased service value. Its client base primarily consists of institutions and high-net-worth individuals who value service quality and expertise more than the number of users on a platform. Although the company may reach more potential clients through its brokerage network, this connection does not form a strong, self-reinforcing network effect barrier."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Stifel Financial 受惠於其在特定市場和服務領域的規模經濟。作為一家較大的金融服務公司，它能夠透過集中採購、共享後台基礎設施和技術平台，降低運營成本。相較於小型獨立經紀商或諮詢公司，Stifel 在交易執行、研究分析和合規管理方面具有成本優勢。這種規模優勢使其能夠在競爭激烈的市場中提供有競爭力的價格，並維持健康的利潤率，尤其是在其核心的財富管理和投資銀行業務中。","comment_en":"Stifel Financial benefits from economies of scale in its specific markets and service areas. As a larger financial services firm, it can reduce operating costs through centralized procurement, shared back-office infrastructure, and technology platforms. Compared to smaller independent brokers or consulting firms, Stifel has a cost advantage in trade execution, research analysis, and compliance management. This scale advantage allows it to offer competitive pricing in a highly competitive market and maintain healthy profit margins, especially in its core wealth management and investment banking businesses."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"Stifel Financial 的地理優勢主要體現在其在美國特定地區的深耕和客戶關係網絡。公司在美國中西部和東北部地區擁有較強的市場地位和品牌認知度。然而，其業務模式並非依賴於獨特的自然資源或地理位置，其核心競爭力在於專業服務和客戶關係，這些是可以跨地域複製的。雖然其現有網絡帶來一定的地域壁壘，但並非絕對的、不可複製的資產，尤其是在全球化和數字化的趨勢下。","comment_en":"Stifel Financial's geographical advantage is mainly reflected in its deep penetration and client relationship network in specific regions of the United States. The company holds a strong market position and brand recognition in the Midwest and Northeast regions of the US. However, its business model does not rely on unique natural resources or geographical locations; its core competitiveness lies in professional services and client relationships, which are replicable across regions. While its existing network creates some regional barriers, these are not absolute, irreplicable assets, especially in the era of globalization and digitalization."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Stifel Financial 在營運效率方面表現出色，這從其穩定的 ROE（16.2%）和 ROA（2.2%）以及強勁的自由現金流（FCF TTM: $417.7M）可見一斑。公司透過精細化的客戶管理、優化的後台流程和對技術的持續投入，實現了較高的盈利能力。其穩健的資產負債表（現金 $3,721.1M / 負債 $839.6M）也顯示了其良好的財務管理和風險控制能力。這種高效的運營是其能夠在競爭中保持優勢的關鍵。","comment_en":"Stifel Financial demonstrates excellent operational efficiency, as evidenced by its stable ROE (16.2%) and ROA (2.2%), along with strong free cash flow (FCF TTM: $417.7M). The company achieves high profitability through refined client management, optimized back-office processes, and continuous investment in technology. Its robust balance sheet (Cash $3,721.1M / Debt $839.6M) also reflects its sound financial management and risk control capabilities. This high operational efficiency is key to its ability to maintain a competitive edge."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Stifel Financial 的管理層在資本配置方面展現了較高的智慧和紀律。公司透過有機增長、戰略性收購以及股東回報（如股息和股票回購）來優化資本使用。其穩健的資產負債表和充裕的現金儲備，使其能夠靈活應對市場變化，並抓住增長機會。管理層對資本配置的審慎態度，有助於提升股東價值，並維持公司長期的健康發展，這符合巴菲特對優秀企業的標準。","comment_en":"Stifel Financial's management demonstrates high wisdom and discipline in capital allocation. The company optimizes capital utilization through organic growth, strategic acquisitions, and shareholder returns (such as dividends and share buybacks). Its solid balance sheet and ample cash reserves enable it to respond flexibly to market changes and seize growth opportunities. Management's prudent approach to capital allocation helps enhance shareholder value and maintain the company's long-term healthy development, aligning with Buffett's standards for excellent businesses."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Stifel Financial 在客戶保留方面表現良好，這得益於其長期建立的客戶關係和專業的服務。特別是在財富管理領域，客戶忠誠度是關鍵。公司透過提供個性化的投資建議、卓越的客戶服務和持續的溝通，努力維持客戶的信任和滿意度。雖然金融行業的競爭激烈，但 Stifel 透過其專業能力和對客戶需求的深刻理解，成功地留住了大部分客戶，形成了穩定的收入來源。","comment_en":"Stifel Financial performs well in customer retention, thanks to its long-established client relationships and professional services. Particularly in wealth management, client loyalty is crucial. The company strives to maintain client trust and satisfaction by providing personalized investment advice, excellent customer service, and continuous communication. Despite intense competition in the financial industry, Stifel successfully retains most of its clients through its professional capabilities and deep understanding of client needs, forming a stable revenue stream."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Stifel Financial 的業務模式具有相當的持久性。作為一家提供金融服務的公司，其核心業務（財富管理、投資銀行）在經濟週期中相對穩定，尤其是在服務高淨值客戶和機構方面。儘管金融行業面臨技術變革和監管壓力，但 Stifel 透過其穩健的財務狀況、專業團隊和對客戶關係的重視，展現了較強的韌性。其持續的盈利能力和資本配置能力，也為其長期生存和發展提供了保障。","comment_en":"Stifel Financial's business model possesses considerable durability. As a financial services provider, its core businesses (wealth management, investment banking) are relatively stable through economic cycles, especially in serving high-net-worth clients and institutions. Despite facing technological changes and regulatory pressures in the financial industry, Stifel demonstrates strong resilience through its sound financial condition, professional team, and emphasis on client relationships. Its sustained profitability and capital allocation capabilities also provide a foundation for its long-term survival and development."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Stifel Financial 的經濟護城河主要體現在其穩健的客戶關係、較高的轉換成本以及在特定市場的規模優勢。其品牌價值和專業服務能力，使其能夠在財富管理和投資銀行領域獲得穩定的客戶基礎和合理的定價權。儘管缺乏專利或顯著的網絡效應，但其營運效率和管理層的資本配置能力，為公司提供了持久的競爭力。整體而言，Stifel 具備類似於「收費橋」的特徵，透過提供關鍵的金融服務，從而從客戶的資產中獲取穩定回報，其護城河雖非無懈可擊，但足以支持其長期穩健發展。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Stifel Financial's economic moat is primarily reflected in its solid client relationships, high switching costs, and scale advantages in specific markets. Its brand value and professional service capabilities enable it to secure a stable client base and reasonable pricing power in wealth management and investment banking. Despite lacking patents or significant network effects, its operational efficiency and management's capital allocation capabilities provide the company with enduring competitiveness. Overall, Stifel exhibits characteristics similar to a 'toll bridge,' generating stable returns from client assets by providing essential financial services. While its moat is not impenetrable, it is sufficient to support its long-term, stable development.","evidenceHash":"970c1a9721d260e008ed4b733ef1e16a3ef68019b271c1765bd9f6bb378f1187","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":4,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"distress","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-31T02:49:35.117Z","evidenceHash":"88d90b4fb4483fa0bb5f5e2fa6b72e9a3d46ae89db32ce6cf188ae7aebb9409b"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"windowDressing","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-31T02:49:35.117Z","evidenceHash":"88d90b4fb4483fa0bb5f5e2fa6b72e9a3d46ae89db32ce6cf188ae7aebb9409b"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/SF.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/SF.png","website":"https://www.stifel.com","ceo":"Ronald James Kruszewski","full_time_employees":"8900","description":"Stifel Financial Corp. operates as the bank holding company for Stifel, Nicolaus & Company, Incorporated that provides retail and institutional wealth management, and investment banking services to individual, corporations, municipalities, and institutions in the United States, the United Kingdom, Canada, and internationally. It operates in three segments: Global Wealth Management, Institutional Group, and Other. The company provides private client services, including securities transaction and financial planning services; securities brokerage services, such as the sale of equities, mutual funds, fixed income products, and insurance; institutional equity and fixed income sales, trading and research, and municipal finance services; investment banking services, such as mergers and acquisitions, public offerings, and private placements; and retail and commercial banking services comprising personal and commercial lending programs, as well as deposit accounts. It participates in and manages underwritings for corporate and public finance; and offers financial advisory and securities brokerage services. The company was founded in 1890 and is headquartered in Saint Louis, Missouri.","description_en":"Stifel Financial Corp. operates as the bank holding company for Stifel, Nicolaus & Company, Incorporated that provides retail and institutional wealth management, and investment banking services to individual, corporations, municipalities, and institutions in the United States, the United Kingdom, Canada, and internationally. It operates in three segments: Global Wealth Management, Institutional Group, and Other. The company provides private client services, including securities transaction and financial planning services; securities brokerage services, such as the sale of equities, mutual funds, fixed income products, and insurance; institutional equity and fixed income sales, trading and research, and municipal finance services; investment banking services, such as mergers and acquisitions, public offerings, and private placements; and retail and commercial banking services comprising personal and commercial lending programs, as well as deposit accounts. It participates in and manages underwritings for corporate and public finance; and offers financial advisory and securities brokerage services. The company was founded in 1890 and is headquartered in Saint Louis, Missouri.","description_zh":"Stifel Financial Corp（美股代碼：SF）為 Financial Services 領域之重要企業，專注於 Financial - Capital Markets 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"One Financial Plaza","city":"Saint Louis","state":"MO","zip":"63102-2188","country":"US","phone":"314 342 2000","full_address":"One Financial Plaza, Saint Louis, MO 63102-2188, US","range_52w":"65.4-89.83","year_high":89.83,"year_low":65.4,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":65.4,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-07-27","name":"Brown Maryam S.","title":"director","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":2500,"price":79.25,"total_val":0.2},{"date":"2026-07-27","name":"Brown Maryam S.","title":"director","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":2200,"price":79.14,"total_val":0.17},{"date":"2026-06-11","name":"Berlew Adam T.","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":2450,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-06-11","name":"Brown Maryam S.","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":2450,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-06-11","name":"BROWN MICHAEL W","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":2450,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-06-11","nam